---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy · WINKS London" description="WINKS London privacy information.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="page-hero__watermark">PRIVATE</span><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4 page-hero__content"><div class="breadcrumb-line"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span class="current">Privacy</span></div><span class="eyebrow mt-4">WINKS London</span><h1>Your privacy<br /><em>comes first.</em></h1><p>A short, plain-English privacy summary for this prototype.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--line"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="content-grid"><article class="content-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy summary</span><h2>Private by<br /><em>design.</em></h2><p>WINKS uses contact details and booking information only to respond to enquiries, check availability and manage a reservation. We do not publish a public directory of professionals or share guest information for advertising.</p><p>Before launch, connect every form to a secure server-side handler, add your final business identity and publish a complete UK GDPR privacy notice with your data controller, retention periods, lawful basis and data-subject rights.</p><p>Do not upload sensitive documents to this prototype. The application page is a front-end demonstration until a secure encrypted upload service is connected.</p></article><aside class="content-aside"><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">Before launch</span><ul class="aside-list"><li>Add legal business identity</li><li>Connect encrypted forms</li><li>Publish full GDPR notice</li><li>Set retention policy</li></ul></div></aside></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
